    <item>
      <title>European Workshop on Reinforcement Learning (EWRL 2025) 📜</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/post/ewrl_2025/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 17 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/post/ewrl_2025/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;In September 2025, I went to Tübingen, Germany for the 18th European Workshop on Reinforcement Learning (EWRL). I had the chance to talk to brilliant researchers in RL and game theory from around Europe, exchange publications and preprints, and discuss the (somewhat volatile) state of machine learning research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I also presented my preprint, &lt;a href=&#34;https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.12117&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;K-Level Policy Gradients for Multi-Agent Reinforcement Learning&lt;/a&gt; as a poster, which garnered some nice attention, especially from other multi-agent RL researchers and Peter Dayan(!)&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;div class=&#34;clearfix&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;img-container-1&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;poster.png&#34; style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px&#34;&gt;
    &lt;figcaption&gt;Presenting my poster...&lt;/figcaption&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



  &lt;div class=&#34;clearfix&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;img-container-1&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;poster_dayan.png&#34; style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px&#34;&gt;
    &lt;figcaption&gt;
    ...to Peter Dayan&lt;/figcaption&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;



  &lt;div class=&#34;clearfix&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;img-container-3&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;mahdi.png&#34; style=&#34;margin-bottom: 10px&#34;&gt;
    &lt;figcaption&gt;Mahdi Kallel at the social event&lt;/figcaption&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;img-container-3&#34;&gt;
